# The AI uses device actions (tools/call) through the same registry as keys and taps (foundation §6.1).
# 1) "翻到下一页": reader.next_page -> done, the page turns, the receipt's "say" is spoken
# 2) a tool call prepared for an older page -> stale, nothing happens
# 3) "切换到孩子的空间": system.switch_member -> done, the child's home
# 4) as the child, "恢复出厂设置": system.factory_reset -> rejected by the policy gate
@3s      tap   116dp 160dp        # 阅读
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      key   next
+2s      mic   speech
+0ms     key   ai 1200ms
+8s      snap  tool-next
+1s      key   ai 1200ms
+8s      snap  tool-stale
+1s      key   ai 1200ms
+8s      snap  kid-home
+1s      key   ai 1200ms
+8s      snap  kid-rejected
+1s      end
